If a clinical-practice-organization has a naloxone-training-resource then the clinical-practice-organization can facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every pharmacist-collaborative-practice-model can facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every statewide-naloxone-protocol can facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
Every pharmacy-naloxone-standing-order can facilitate a naloxone-coprescribing.
